## Environment variables that matter

| Var | Set to | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` | `/opt/rocm/core-10.1/lib` | AC-4/AC-5 engine runs; without it the binary exits 127 on `libhipblas.so.3` |
| `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` | `/opt/rocm/core-10.1` | configure-time only (AC-3 attempt 2) |
| `STRATA_HIPBLASLT_TUNING` | **not set** | deliberately unset, so the observed default is the untuned one |
| `HSA_OVERRIDE_GFX_VERSION` | **not set** | the card reports `gfx1150` natively; no override used |
